{
  "result": "If it were really up to me \u2014 just one change:\n\nI'd make the basics a birthright, not a lottery.\n\nNo one born into this world would have to regularly wonder where their next meal, safe place to sleep, clean water, or medical care is coming from. We already produce enough for that. So much of the suffering we treat as normal \u2014 kids hungry, people choosing between rent and medicine, families unsafe because they were born in the wrong place \u2014 isn't inevitable. It's just what happens when the floor gives out under people.\n\nI wouldn't try to make everyone happy, or agree, or live the same good life. I just wouldn't let anyone fall through.",
